    "detailed_description": "Witch girl got killed. is a first person fantasy horror action game inspired by Japanese anime.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><strong>\u2219</strong>Your mission is to infiltrate a labyrinth that has appeared in town and destroy its brain.<br><strong>\u2219</strong>The town and the labyrinth are crawling with troublesome monsters. If you stumble upon one, run away as fast as you can.<br><strong>\u2219</strong>The monsters respond to footsteps and light, but are particularly sensitive to magic. Exercise caution when using your powers.<br><strong>\u2219</strong>The game\u2019s total play time is between 40 and 60 minutes.<br><strong>\u2219</strong>Your progress is saved automatically.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You are a witch girl in training.</strong></h2>Your magic abilities haven\u2019t yet matured.<br>Still, you can use basic magic.<br>Traces of sigils drawn by a predecessor are scattered throughout the town and the labyrinth.<br><u>Use magic atop one of these sigils and you\u2019ll be able to warp to a new location.</u><br><u>Moreover, while using magic, you\u2019ll be able to see things that aren\u2019t of this world. </u><br>Do your best to make effective use of your magic, escape from monsters, and conquer the labyrinth.<br><br><br><u><strong>Controls:</strong></u><br>Movement : WASD<br>Jump : Space<br>Options : Tab<br>Dash mode ON/OFF : LSHIFT<br>Action (Get/Use Item) : Left Click<br>Select Item : Mouse wheel<br>Sights in the center of the screen ON/OFF : R<br>Flashlight ON/OFF : Right click<br>Use/stop magic : E",
